{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"finite element thermal discretization finite element thermal discretization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","fileName":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:55\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Finite Element Thermal Modeling]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Mesh Independence Study","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"finite element thermal discretization finite element thermal discretization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","fileName":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization","heading":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The finite element method replaces a continuous thermal domain with a collection of small elements joined at nodes. Within each element, temperature is approximated from nodal values, allowing the governing heat equation to become a finite system of algebraic equations.\n\nDiscretization makes irregular geometry and nonuniform properties tractable, but it introduces approximation error. Element type, size, and distribution must resolve important gradients, and a [[Mesh Independence Study|refinement study]] must show that the chosen mesh supports the reported quantity.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Mesh Independence Study","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"finite element thermal discretization finite element thermal discretization","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","fileName":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Finite Element Thermal Discretization","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Finite Element Thermal Modeling","Mesh Independence Study","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}